    {"id": 1, "claim": "The bacteria described are magnetotactic bacteria, characterized by the presence of intracellular magnetosomes.", "evidence": "The prompt specifies bacteria using iron to guide movement; magnetotactic bacteria are the only known group that synthesizes chains of iron-oxide (magnetite) or iron-sulfide crystals (magnetosomes) for this specific purpose.", "weight": 0.3, "depends_on": []},
